          "endTime" : 1787910199931,
          "interpreter" : "md",
          "taskStatus" : "SUCCESS",
          "status" : "SUCCESS",
          "results" : [
            {
              "message" : "<p><em><strong>Goal</strong></em></p>\n<p>This notebook introduces important graph algorithms available in Oracle AI Database 26ai.</p>\n<p><strong>You will learn how to:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Use SQL graph analytics and PGX algorithms, including PageRank and weakly connected components (WCC).</li>\n<li>Use the PGX Python API for DeepWalk, betweenness centrality, and closeness centrality.</li>\n<li>Identify potential fraud patterns, bridge accounts, and major account clusters.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Some Questions explored in this notebook:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>How many weakly connected components are in <code>BANK_GRAPH</code>?</li>\n<li>Which accounts receive the most transfers?</li>\n<li>Which accounts are most influential in the payment network?</li>\n<li>How are accounts 934, 387, and 135 connected through transfers?</li>\n<li>Which accounts have transfer patterns similar to accounts 934 and 387?</li>\n<li>Which accounts act as bridges between major clusters?</li>\n<li>Which accounts have the most circular payment chains?</li>\n<li>More...</li>\n</ul>\n",
              "type" : "HTML"
            }
          ],
          "forms" : "[]"
        },
        "relations" : [ ],
        "dynamicFormParams" : "{}"
      },
      {
        "row" : 0,
        "col" : 0,
        "sizeX" : 0,
        "width" : 12,
        "title" : "Grant Users",
        "hasTitle" : true,
        "message" : [
          "%sql\r",
          "--as admin\r",
          "GRANT CREATE PROPERTY GRAPH TO USER;\r",
          "GRANT GRAPH_DEVELOPER TO USER;\r",
          "GRANT PGX_SESSION_CREATE TO USER;\r",
          "GRANT CREATE SESSION TO USER;\r",
          "GRANT CREATE TABLE TO USER;\r",
          "GRANT CREATE VIEW TO USER;\r",
          "GRANT CREATE SEQUENCE TO USER;\r",
          "GRANT CREATE PROCEDURE TO USER;\r",
          "GRANT PGX_SESSION_GET_PUBLISHED_GRAPH TO USER;\r",
          "---AI\r",
          "grant execute on DBMS_CLOUD to <user> ; \r",
          "grant execute on DBMS_CLOUD_AI to <user> ;\r",
          "grant EXECUTE on DBMS_Cloud_AI_AGENT to <user> ;\r",
          "grant CREATE ANY INDEX to <user>;\r",
          "grant EXECUTE on DBMS_VECTOR to <user> ;"
        ],
        "selectedVisualization" : null,
        "visualizationConfig" : null,
        "hideCode" : false,
        "hideResult" : false,
        "hideGutter" : true,
        "hideVizConfig" : false,
