            {
              "message" : "<p>We created the graph using the Graph Studio modeler. However, in the following paragraph, we provide the <strong>CREATE PROPERTY GRAPH SQL statement</strong>, which you can use to create a graph anywhere SQL queries are supported.</p>\n<p><span style=\"display: inline-block; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #2B6689; color: white; width: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;\">i</span> This paragraph has the run button disabled and is included as an example.</p>\n",
              "type" : "HTML"
            }
          ],
          "forms" : "[]"
