              "message" : "<p>First, we checked whether all 1,000 ACCOUNT vertices belong to a single weakly connected component. The WCC result showed a single component ID, meaning all accounts are part of one connected network and there are no isolated groups of accounts.</p>\n<p>WCC result: All 1,000 ACCOUNT vertices belong to a single weakly connected component. This means all accounts are part of one connected network and there are no isolated groups of accounts.</p>\n",
