            {
              "message" : "<p>We looked at accounts with the most incoming transfers and those which were simply conduits. Now let's query the graph to determine if there are any circular payment chains, i.e. a sequence of transfers that start and end at the same account.\nFirst let's check if there are <strong>any 3-hop (triangles) transfers that start and end at the same account</strong>.</p>\n<p>This query lists such accounts, ordered by the number of triangles that start and end with that account.</p>\n",
