        "message" : [
          "%md\r",
          "\r",
          "So far, we used the knowledge that a highly connected account might be fraudulent, or when money moves in a cycle then there is potential fraud. \r",
          "What if we did **not know this about this specific domain**, that cycles might indicate fraud? What if we only new that accounts 934 and 387 are fraudulent, \r",
          "but did not have the additional information on what <i> patterns </i> might constitute fraud?\r",
          "\r",
          "We can use a **Graph Machine Learning** algorithm like **DeepWalk** to find accounts that have a similar structure to an account. \r",
          "We don't know what structure we are looking for, we are looking for any structure that is similar. \r",
          "That is the power of machine learning - **you can find similarities even if you don't know exactly what are you are looking for**."
        ],
