        "message" : [
          "If we ask :\"Which accounts have many cycles?\" it aggregates/counts the cycle paths by: account_id + hop_count  934 | 4 hops | 27 cycles . So account 934 has 27 distinct 5-hop cycle paths in BANK_GRAPH"
        ],
